{"file":"design-superpowers-1.0.0-v1.zip","bytes":1588583,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"design-superpowers","description":"Six Claude Code commands that make AI work like a design team: direction, design systems, product design, review, governance. Maturity-aware (L0 greenfield to L3 enterprise), Figma-optional via PluginOS, font-aware, behavior-validated.","version":"1.0.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/LSDimi/design-superpowers","homepage":"https://github.com/LSDimi/design-superpowers"},{"path":"plugin.json","name":"design-superpowers","description":"Six Claude Code commands that make AI work like a design team: direction, design systems, product design, review, governance. Maturity-aware (L0 greenfield to L3 enterprise), Figma-optional via PluginOS, font-aware, behavior-validated.","version":"1.0.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/LSDimi/design-superpowers","homepage":"https://github.com/LSDimi/design-superpowers","keywords":["design","design-system","figma","creative","ux","accessibility"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/creative/SKILL.md","name":"creative","description":"Use when exploring visual direction, generating moodboards, proposing color palettes, typography systems, layout strategies, imagery/art direction, refreshing an existing design language, or setting brand-level direction. Activates for /creative, \"help me find a visual direction\", \"propose a palette\", \"what typography should we use\", \"moodboard\", \"font pairing\", \"grid system\", \"refresh our look\", \"rebrand\", \"art direction\".","headings":["/creative — Creative Direction","Maturity Detection","Figma inspection","Always Load","Sub-Agent Router","Imagery in deliverables","Sub-Agent: Moodboard Generator","Ask first","Workflow","Output format","Sub-Agent: Palette Architect","Ask first","Workflow","Output format","Palette — <Theme Statement>","Neutral Scale","Brand Scale","Semantic"],"name_hint":"creative","description_zh":"探索视觉方向、情绪板、色板、字体、布局、图像和艺术指导，用于更新设计语言或品牌方向。"},{"path":"skills/design-review/SKILL.md","name":"design-review","description":"Use to evaluate existing designs against UX heuristics, accessibility standards, DS compliance, visual quality, or motion principles. Activates for /design-review, \"review this design\", \"audit UI\", \"check accessibility\", \"is this compliant\", \"critique this screen\", \"WCAG check\", \"visual audit\", \"does this follow our DS\".","headings":["/design-review — Design Validation","Maturity Detection","Always Load","Multi-Sub-Agent Execution","Sub-Agent Router","Aggregated Output Format","Design Review — <Screen/File Name>","What's working (required — ≥3)","P0 — Blockers (must fix before release)","P1 — Major (fix in this sprint)","P2 — Minor (fix before handoff)","P3 — Cosmetic (fix when possible)","Summary","Sub-Agent: Visual Quality Inspector","Ask first","Workflow","Output format (per sub-agent, before aggregation)","Visual Quality Findings — <Screen Name>"],"name_hint":"设计 · 评审","description_zh":"按UX启发式、可访问性、设计系统、视觉质量与动效原则评估现有设计。"},{"path":"skills/design/SKILL.md","name":"design","description":"Use when designing product features, flows, pages, or screens using an existing design system or design language. Activates for /design, \"design a feature\", \"build a page\", \"select components\", \"compose a flow\", \"what component should I use\", \"layout this screen\", \"is there a pattern for\", \"we're missing a component\".","headings":["/design — Product Design with DS","Maturity Detection","Always Load","Hard Rules (all maturity levels)","Imagery in deliverables","Sub-Agent Router","Sub-Agent: Component Selector","Ask first","Workflow","Output format","Component Recommendation — <Need Description>","Alternatives Considered","Notes","Sub-Agent: Layout Composer","Ask first","Workflow","Output format","Layout Proposal — <Page/Flow Name>"],"name_hint":"设计","description_zh":"使用既有设计系统或语言设计产品功能、流程、页面和屏幕，选择组件与模式，并识别缺失组件。"},{"path":"skills/ds-consumer/SKILL.md","name":"ds-consumer","description":"Use when designing product features using an enterprise DS, evaluating existing UI, selecting DS components, reviewing information architecture, or requesting new components. Also use when fixing detached components in Figma files.","headings":["DS Consumer","Relationship to /design","Hard Rules (Non-Negotiable)","Activation","Workflows","1. Design a New Feature/Page","1b. Pre-Handoff Checklist","2. Evaluate Existing UI","3. Component Selection","4. Component Gap Request (Consumer → Producer)","5. Detached Component Detection & Reconnection","Product Awareness","Common UI Contexts","General UI Patterns","Anti-Patterns","UX Evaluation Framework","Token Efficiency"],"name_hint":"ds · consumer","description_zh":"依据企业设计系统设计功能、评估UI、选择组件和信息架构，提出新组件需求，也修复Figma脱离库的组件。"},{"path":"skills/ds-make/SKILL.md","name":"ds-make","description":"Use when creating, updating, versioning, or deprecating design system tokens, components, or patterns. Activates for /ds-make, \"new component\", \"add token\", \"create a variant\", \"update a component\", \"bump version\", \"deprecate X\", \"semver\", \"scaffold design system\", \"token naming\", \"breaking change\".","headings":["/ds-make — DS Creation & Lifecycle","Maturity Detection","Always Load","Sub-Agent Router","Sub-Agent: Token Architect","Ask first","Workflow","Output format","Token Proposal — <Category>","Primitives (if new)","Semantic Bindings","Component Tokens (if applicable)","Sub-Agent: Component Builder","Ask first","Workflow","Output format","Component Spec — <ComponentName>","Variant Matrix"],"name_hint":"ds · make","description_zh":"创建、更新、版本化或弃用设计系统令牌、组件及模式，处理变体、命名、语义版本与破坏性变化。"},{"path":"skills/ds-manage/SKILL.md","name":"ds-manage","description":"Use for DS operations — publishing cascades, adoption analytics, documentation generation, health and drift monitoring. Activates for /ds-manage, \"publish\", \"release cascade\", \"adoption report\", \"generate docs\", \"uspec\", \"check health\", \"library drift\", \"detached components\", \"DS audit\".","headings":["/ds-manage — DS Operations","Maturity Detection","Always Load","Sub-Agent Router","Workflow Chains","Sub-Agent: Publisher","Ask first","Workflow","Output format","Publish Plan — <Artifact Name> v<X.Y.Z>","Pre-Publish Gate","Cascade Map","Changelog Entries","Blockers","Sub-Agent: Analytics Reporter","Ask first","Workflow","Output format"],"name_hint":"ds · manage","description_zh":"管理设计系统发布联动、采用率分析、文档生成和健康漂移监测，检查库与脱离组件。"},{"path":"skills/ds-producer/SKILL.md","name":"ds-producer","description":"Use when creating, updating, auditing, documenting, versioning, or publishing DS components, foundations, icons, or patterns. Also use when managing Shortcut tickets for DS work or running governance checklists.","headings":["DS Producer","Relationship to /ds-make","Activation","Operational Modes","Workflows","1. New Component / Foundation / Icon / Pattern","2. Update Existing Component","3. Quality Audit","4. Documentation Generation","5. Publishing (Cascading Update Pipeline)","6. Deprecation","7. Handle Consumer Component Requests","Figma Plugin Integration","DS Lint (Configured Lint Tool — `{{governance.lint.tool}}`)","Library Analytics (Node.js CLI — NOT a Figma plugin)","Prostar","uSpec (via MCP)","Shortcut Integration"],"name_hint":"ds · producer","description_zh":"创建、更新、审计、记录、版本化和发布设计系统组件、基础、图标与模式，也管理Shortcut工单和治理清单。"},{"path":"skills/figma-setup/SKILL.md","name":"figma-setup","description":"Install or verify PluginOS for Figma work in design-superpowers. Use when the user runs `/figma-setup`, asks how to set up Figma integration, or hits a Figma command without PluginOS installed.","headings":["/figma-setup","What you do","Step 0 — Check current state","Step 1 — Print the install pitch","Step 2 — Verify after the user says \"ready\"","Bridge plugin troubleshooting","Boundaries","Cross-references"],"name_hint":"figma · 设置","description_zh":"为design-superpowers的